msgstr "Provedor de nuvem"

#: aurora/settingsapp/ai.py:102
msgid "Questions and the text you ask about are sent to the provider. Keys are kept in your login keyring. Claude and ChatGPT subscriptions work only in their own apps: Dev Hub installs Claude Code and Codex, which sign in with your subscription."
msgstr "As perguntas e o texto sobre o qual você pergunta são enviados ao provedor. As chaves ficam no seu chaveiro de login. As assinaturas do Claude e do ChatGPT só funcionam nos aplicativos deles: o Dev Hub instala o Claude Code e o Codex, que entram com a sua assinatura."

#: aurora/settingsapp/ai.py:108
msgid "API keys are paid per use"
msgstr "Chaves de API são pagas por uso"

#: aurora/settingsapp/ai.py:109
